# Runs that recorded a silent CPU fallback rather than GPU execution: kept on
# disk for reference, never committed - the numbers do not measure what the
# harness claims to measure.
*/invalid-*/
# Figure previews; the committed figure is the vector PDF beside them.
*/*/figures/*.png
*/*/figures/*.svg
# run_models.sh's argmax scratch: one file per system, written and re-read
# inside a single stage and deleted when it ends. Never a result.
*/*/.last_argmax_*
